Animator placeholder

Create an Animator Controller at Assets/Animations/Alpinator.controller and add the following states:
- Idle (use alpinator_idle frames, loop)
- Walk (use alpinator_walk frames, loop)
- Catch (use alpinator_catch frames, not loop)
- Dizzy (use alpinator_dizzy frames, loop)

Parameters:
- Speed (float)
- IsCatching (bool)
- IsDizzy (bool)

Transitions:
- Idle <-> Walk controlled by Speed threshold
- AnyState -> Catch when IsCatching true (exit to Idle when finished)
- AnyState -> Dizzy when IsDizzy true

Attach the Animator to the Player prefab and hook the AnimationClips.
